</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The Bank will repay capital (from Share Premium) on Mars 27th, 2026<br>•	0.0659 USD per share (USD 5 382 504)<br>•	0.637 NOK per share (NOK 52 043 206)<br>•	Exchange rate 9.662<br>•	Payout currency: NOK<br>Last day inclusive: March 18th<br>Date exclusive: March19th <br>Owner register date (VPS): March 20th <br>Resolution date: March 12th, 2026</p></td>
