</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Endre Røsjø, Chair of the board of directors in Maritime & Merchant Bank ASA, has bought 1,000 shares in Maritime & Merchant Bank ASA at price of NOK 18.00 per share and 2,000 shares at price of NOK 17.50.<br>Following the transactions, Endre Røsjø holds 20 422 790 shares in Maritime & Merchant Bank ASA.</p></td>
