<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The profit for the period 01.01.25 - 30.09.2025 before tax is USD 9 048 428 (USD 13 145 218 in 2024).<br>Customer lending as of 30.09.2025 was USD 403 706 158 (USD 366 450 391 in Q3 2024). <br>Book value per share is USD 1.71 per 30.09.2025 (USD 1.67 in 3Q 2024)<br>Earnings per share for the period 01.01.25 - 30.09.2025 before tax is USD 0.111 (USD 0.161 in 2024).<br><br>There has been no credit losses and the Bank has no non-performing loans.</p></td>
