</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The profit for the period 01.01.25 - 30.06.2025 before tax is USD 6 158 079 (USD 8 908 725 in 2024).<br>Customer lending as of 30.06.2025 was USD 366 667 790 (USD 389 709 894 in Q2 2024). <br><br>Book value per share is USD 1.681 per 30.06.2025 (USD 1.629 in 2Q 2024)<br>Earnings per share for the period 01.01.25 - 30.06.2025 before tax is USD 0.0754 (USD 0.109 in 2024).<br><br>There has been no credit losses and the Bank has no non-performing loans.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
