</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The profit for the period 01.01.24 - 31.12.2024 before tax is USD 16 458 564 (USD 18 582 116 in 2023). Profit after tax is USD 9 018 133 as of 31.12.2024 (12 899 987 in 2023). <br>Book value per share is USD 1.66 before dividend (USD 1.61 in 2023) Earnings per share for the period 01.01.24 - 31.12.2024 before tax is USD 0.2015 (USD 0.2273 in 2023).<br>The Board of Directors propose a dividend of USD 0.033 per share (USD 2 705 440, which is 30% of the profit after tax). The proposal will take place in accordance with the regulatory framework.<br>There have been no credit losses during 2024 and the Bank has zero non-performing loans. <br>Since the start in 2017 the bank has disbursed USD 1.3 billion in mortgage secured term loans and financed approx. 230 ships and have not experienced losses during this period.</p></td>
