</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The profit for the period 01.01.24 - 30.6.2024 (H1 2024) before tax is USD 8 908 725 (USD 9 435 628  in H1 2023).<br>Profit after tax is USD 6 676 540 in H1 2024 (USD 7 076 654 in H1 2023).  <br>The ROE in the period 01.01-30.06 (H1 2024) was 14.1% before tax, down from 15.4% before tax in H1-2023.<br>Book value per share is USD 1.63 per 30-06-2024 (USD 1.54 per 30-06-2023).<br>Earnings per share for the period 01.01.24 - 30.06.2024 before tax is USD 0.109 in H1 2024 (USD 0.1155 in H1 2023).<br>There has been no credit losses and the Bank has no non-performing loans.</p></td>
</tr>
