<td><h2>Maritime & Merchant Bank ASA (MMBANK) Financial Report 31.12.2022.</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2023-02-14 16:30:36</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The profit for the period 01.01.21 - 31.12.2022 before tax is USD 13 627 283 (USD 7 950 395 in 2021).<br>Profit after tax is USD 7 188 697 as of 31.12.2022 (5 093 351 in 2021). <br>Book value per share is USD 15 (USD 14.31 in 2021).<br>Earnings per share for the period 01.01.22 - 31.12.2022 before tax is USD 1.67 (USD 0.97 in 2021).<br><br>The Board of Directors propose a dividend of USD 0.489 per share (USD 4 000 000, which is 56% of Profit after tax). The proposal will take place in accordance with the regulatory framework.<br><br>The amount of net disbursed loans increased with 18% during the period 01.01.22 - 31.12.2022 from <br>USD 316 mill to USD 372 mill. <br><br>There has been no credit losses and the Bank has zero non-performing loans. Total disbursed loans since start of operation in 2017 amounts to USD 850 mill and the bank has not experienced any credit loss of significance during these 6 years.</p></td>
</tr>
