<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Maritime & Merchant Bank ASA (MMBANK) Financial Report 31.12.2020.<br>The profit for the period 01.09 - 31.12 (Q4) before tax is USD 2 126 789 (Q3 USD 1 524 937).<br>The profit before tax for the period 01.01.20 - 31.12.2020 is USD 5 931 710 (01.01 - 31.12.2019, USD 11 060 054).<br>Profit after tax for the period 01.01.20 - 31.12.2020 is USD 5 232 714 (01.01 - 31.12.2019, USD 8 076 684).<br>Earnings per share before tax USD 0.726 (USD 1.3537 in 2019).<br>Book value per share is USD 13.9.<br>The Board of Directors propose a dividend of USD 0.18 per share (USD 1 470 609).<br>The bank has no non-performing loans.</p></td>
