</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The profit for 2019 before tax is USD 11.060.054 (USD 1.250.045 in 2018), after tax USD 8.076.684 (USD -336.916 in 2018). Return of Equity before tax is 11.77% (1.61% in 2018) and the Net Interest Margin is 3.81% (3.10% in 2018). <br><br>The bank has lent out USD 295.124.509 to customers as per 31.12.2019 (USD 249.024.326 as per 31.12.2018). <br><br>There have been no defaults on any loans.</p></td>
