<td colspan="3"><p>The profit for the period 01.07 - 30.09 (Q3) before tax is USD 2.814.845 (Q2: USD 2.739.875).<br>Return on Equity before tax is 10.78 % (Q2: 12.1%) and the Net Interest Margin is 3.72% (Q2: 3.68%) <br>during the same period.<br><br>The bank has lent out USD 294.862.165 to customers as per 30.09. <br>There has been no defaults on these loans.  <br><br>The profit before tax as per 30.09 is USD 8.006.263 for 2019 and the Return on Equity before tax is 11.6%.</p></td>
