<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The general meeting of Maritime & Merchant Bank ASA ("MMBANK") approved on 1 March  2019 that the share capital is increased by minimum NOK 6,250,000 and maximum NOK 38,461,538 in a private placement towards existing shareholders and selected new investors.<br><br>MMBANK has engaged Sparebank 1 Markets as sole manager and bookrunner for the private placement.<br>  <br>The board has fixed the subscription price in the private placement to a share price of USD 13.00.</p></td>
