<td colspan="3"><p>The profit for the period before tax is USD 2.451.543 and the profit after tax is USD 2.179.758. The bank has lent USD 272.157.115 to customers. There has not been any default on these loans. Return on Equity before tax is 11.1% during the period and net interest margin is 3.40%.</p></td>
